<title>FRANCE: UAP rises further on rumours.</title>
<headline>UAP rises further on rumours.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UAP rose for the third trading day in a row on continued market rumours that the company could become a bid object, traders said.</p>
<p>At 1033 GMT, UAP was up 2.78 percent at 111 francs.</p>
<p>UAP on Monday denied a rumour, sparked by a report in weekly Le Nouvel Observateur, that it planned a merger with Axa in a deal which would see the latter buying UAP.</p>
